flowchart LR
    subgraph Customer[Client / Integrateur]
        Admin[Admin client]
        System[Systeme client / CI]
    end

    subgraph Bevoac[Bevoac SaaS Azure France Central]
        Front[Frontend onboarding statique]
        API[Fastify API - control plane]
        SB[Azure Service Bus scan-jobs]
        Worker[Container App Worker scale-to-zero]
        PG[(PostgreSQL Flexible Server)]
        KV[Azure Key Vault]
        ACR[Azure Container Registry]
        LAW[Log Analytics]
    end

    subgraph Microsoft[Microsoft Cloud client]
        Entra[Microsoft Entra ID]
        ARM[Azure Resource Manager / Resource Graph]
        Subs[Subscriptions client]
    end

    Admin --> Front
    Front -->|POST /v1/onboarding/azure/start| API
    API -->|URL admin consent avec state HMAC| Front
    Admin -->|admin consent| Entra
    Entra -->|GET /v1/onboarding/azure/callback| API
    API -->|token client_credentials| Entra
    API -->|liste subscriptions accessibles| ARM
    ARM --> Subs
    API -->|tenant_azure_integrations / scopes| PG

    System -->|Bearer API key| API
    API -->|validation tenant, allowlist, quotas| PG
    API -->|message scan.requested| SB
    SB --> Worker
    Worker -->|Resource Graph preflight + modules| ARM
    Worker -->|result JSON / status| PG
    API -->|GET result / PDF / billing| System

    API -. secrets .-> KV
    Worker -. secrets .-> KV
    API -. images .-> ACR
    Worker -. images .-> ACR
    API -. logs .-> LAW
    Worker -. logs .-> LAW
